<section id="about" class="py-24 section-padding">
  <div class="content-max">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Photo -->
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-2 flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber/20 to-transparent rounded-2xl blur-lg"></div>
          <img 
            src="/profile.jpg" 
            alt="Aniekan Udo"
            class="relative w-64 h-64 lg:w-80 lg:h-80 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-2xl"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Bio -->
      <div class="reveal lg:col-span-3" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <p class="text-amber font-mono text-sm tracking-wider mb-2">About Me</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">
          Bridging Healthcare & Technology
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I'm a dual-degree candidate pursuing <strong class="text-text-primary">MB;BS (Medicine & Surgery)</strong> at 
            University of Ibadan and <strong class="text-text-primary">BSc Computer Science</strong> at University of the People. 
            This unique combination allows me to understand healthcare problems from the inside and build 
            technology solutions that actually work in clinical settings.
          </p>
          <p>
            My journey in tech accelerated through <strong class="text-text-primary">6+ intensive programs</strong> in 2024 — 
            from medical image AI at SPARK Academy (where I published research on Glioma segmentation) to 
            leadership training at McKinsey Forward and Aspire Institute. Each experience deepened my 
            commitment to using AI for healthcare in Sub-Saharan Africa.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, I build <strong class="text-text-primary">agentic AI systems, fullstack applications, and data pipelines</strong> — 
            always with an eye toward real-world impact. Whether it's a LangGraph agent for analytics or a 
            Go/React fullstack app for competition data analysis, I bring both technical depth and domain 
            expertise in healthcare.
          </p>
        </div>
        
